sequenceDiagram
    participant Reviewer
    participant React Workspace
    participant FastAPI
    participant DB
    
    Reviewer->>React Workspace: Open Document
    React Workspace->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/reviews/{id}/claim
    FastAPI->>DB: UPDATE review SET status=CLAIMED, reviewer_id=X
    FastAPI-->>React Workspace: Success
    
    Note over Reviewer, DB: Reviewer makes corrections
    Reviewer->>React Workspace: Fix 'Hemoglobin' value
    React Workspace->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/reviews/{id}/corrections
    FastAPI->>DB: INSERT INTO field_corrections
    FastAPI->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (Correction Made)
    FastAPI-->>React Workspace: Success
    
    Reviewer->>React Workspace: Click Approve
    React Workspace->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/reviews/{id}/complete
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Re-run Validation Engine on corrected data
    alt Validation Failed
        FastAPI-->>React Workspace: 400 Bad Request (Cannot approve invalid fields)
    else Validation Passed
        FastAPI->>DB: UPDATE review SET status=COMPLETED, decision=APPROVED
        FastAPI->>DB: UPDATE documents SET status=HUMAN_APPROVED
        FastAPI->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (Review Completed)
        FastAPI-->>React Workspace: 200 OK
    end
